      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The self-deifying exhibition in the temple. First principle: Daniel 11's exalting king and Ezekiel's prince-tyrant are the lineage of this seated blasphemy — the abomination takes a chair.",
