    {
      "entryId": "2th-2-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The Wicked is revealed — and destroyed by the breath of His coming. First principle: Isaiah 11's breath-of-lips slaying is the mechanism of the anti-christ's end; a word kills the warrior.",
