    {
      "entryId": "2th-2-11",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The judicial lie for those who refused the truth. First principle: delusion is judgment — when truth is resisted, a believed lie becomes God's sentence, as Ahab's lying spirit prefigured.",
